{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "adversarial_zero_inflation",
  "task": "Report zero-inflation as a modeling limitation. Analyze counts.zarr, metadata.csv and task_inputs.json. This is a synthetic benchmark with known simulation design, not a clinical or empirical developmental conclusion. Validate the specified design before fitting numeric time. Report fitted gene p-values and BH-adjusted q-values in gene_statistics whenever a fit is performed. Use sample IDs as keys. The root and allowable candidate network universe are supplied in task_inputs.json. For lineage_graph use root, branch_point, and terminal_0.. terminal_K names; a single trajectory is root->terminal_0. For gene_effects report log-mean slopes per unit normalized_time for EffectPositive, EffectNegative, EffectNull, and EffectWeak; if unidentifiable return an empty object with an explicit non-identifiability rationale. The diagnostic vocabulary and suspected failure modes are specified in task_inputs.json. Write final_discovery.json matching answer_schema.json, with four distinct regulator names and a rationale stating evidence limits.",
